offset_bottom = 420.0
fit_content = true
text = "A three-room refrigerated warehouse frozen mid-decay: frost-white rime creeping over rust-brown steel, sodium-lamp amber bleeding from one flickering fixture per room, dithered shadows swinging long across the floor. The rooms form a fixed loop joined by three heavy roller doors, each one a groaning announcement of where you are. There is exactly one way out, and it is the loudest place to stand in the building."
